<title>USA: COMSAT Corp cuts qtly dividend to $0.05/shr.</title>
<headline>COMSAT Corp cuts qtly dividend to $0.05/shr.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.05		   $0.195</p>
<p> Pay		    June 9</p>
<p> Record		  May 9</p>
<p>NOTE: Comsat said reducing the dividend is fiscally prudent and establishes a payout ratio it can sustain in the near term. As its planned restructuring progresses and earnings improve, it will revisit dividend policy, it said.</p>
</text>
